+    """Relay colored rays through a chain of holed objects, keeping only ignited objects recolored.
 
+    Input structure:
+    - Black background with several non-touching single-color 4-connected objects.
+    - Some objects contain exactly one fully enclosed background hole.
+    - Exactly one hole contains a single seed pixel whose color is different from all object colors.
+    - Only the holed, seed-containing object ignites first; rays then continue only through hit stations.
 
